Aim

To develop an online hospital appointment booking system for searching doctors and booking, managing, and cancelling appointments.

Algorithm
Start the program.
Register and log in to the system.
Search for hospitals and doctors by location and specialty.
Select a doctor and book an appointment.
View appointment status and history.
Allow patients to cancel appointments and provide reviews.
Admin manages doctors, hospitals, appointments, and reports.
Stop the program.
Result

Thus, the online hospital appointment booking system was designed to manage doctor searches, patient appointments, and hospital details efficiently.
